{"unit_id": "tag:089R:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节引入标准的格拉斯曼（Grassmannian）函子（functors），并证明它们由概形（schemes）表示（represented）。选取整数（integers）<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>，满足<MATH_0003>。我们将构造一个函子（functor）\n<MATH_0004>\n粗略地说，它将参数化（parametrize）<MATH_0005>维（dimensional）子空间（subspaces），它们位于<MATH_0006>空间（space）中。不过，出于技术原因，参数化（parametrize）<MATH_0007>维（dimensional）商空间（quotients）更方便，因此我们采用这种做法。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n更确切地说，<MATH_0008>把概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>对应到集合（set）<MATH_0010>，它由下列满射（surjections）的同构类（isomorphism classes）组成：\n<MATH_0011>\n其中<MATH_0012>是有限局部自由（finite locally free）<MATH_0013>-模（module），其秩（rank）为<MATH_0014>。注意，这确实是一个集合（set）。例如，可由模（Modules）的引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>看出，也可由如下事实看出：满射（surjection）<MATH_0015>的同构（isomorphism）类（class）由<MATH_0016>的核（kernel）确定（而给定一个层（sheaf），其子层（subsheaves）组成一个集合（set））。给定概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>，令\n<MATH_0018>将<MATH_0019>的同构（isomorphism）类（class）送到<MATH_0020>的同构（isomorphism）类（class）。这样定义是有意义的，因为（1）<MATH_0021>，（2）<MATH_0022>是加性的（additive），（3）<MATH_0023>保持局部自由（locally free）模（modules）（模（Modules）的引理（Lemma）<REF_0002>），并且（4）<MATH_0024>是右正合的（right exact）（模（Modules）的引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "represented", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "integers", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "parametrize", "target_term": "参数化"}, {"source_term": "dimensional", "target_term": "维"}, {"source_term": "subspaces", "target_term": "子空间"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "parametrize", "target_term": "参数化"}, {"source_term": "dimensional", "target_term": "维"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商空间"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "surjections", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "subsheaves", "target_term": "子层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "additive", "target_term": "加性的"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "right exact", "target_term": "右正合的"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼", "context": "修饰所引入的标准函子。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "本节引入的标准格拉斯曼函子。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示这族函子的对象。"}, {"source_term": "represented", "target_term": "表示", "context": "叙述这族函子由概形表示。"}, {"source_term": "integers", "target_term": "整数", "context": "构造中选取的两个参数。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "随后构造的对象。"}, {"source_term": "parametrize", "target_term": "参数化", "context": "概述函子与子空间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "dimensional",