{"unit_id": "tag:089T:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。\n函子（functor）<MATH_0002>由（<REF_0001>）给出，可由概形（scheme）表示（representable）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "引理中断言可表示的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示该函子的对象。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示", "context": "在“可由……表示”中表达函子的可表性。"}], "notes": []}
